%%label III. Andantino
%%note A. A long flute solo over held strings; the oboe follows it in canon; a small dance for clarinet and bassoon; the melody returns in the violins.
X:1
T:Copland’s Missing Symphony
T:III. Andantino
C:Claude (AI), in the manner of Aaron Copland
M:4/4
L:1/8
Q:"Andantino quasi allegretto" 1/4=76
%%score [fl ob cl bn] [hn] pno [v1 v2 va vc cb]
% Original AI-composed homage. The score is written at sounding pitch.
V:fl clef=treble name="Fl. I, II"
V:ob clef=treble name="Ob. I, II"
